1
00:00:02,741 --> 00:00:07,074
Team, we’re hiring a prompt engineer—he’ll
make our AI 10× faster!

2
00:00:07,434 --> 00:00:11,677
What’s the secret sauce, Kyle? I’ve seen
algorithms, not magic.

3
00:00:12,027 --> 00:00:14,377
Just trust the process. He’ll be here
tomorrow.

4
00:00:20,191 --> 00:00:23,421
I’ve got the engineer’s notebook. Let’s
see what’s in it.

5
00:00:23,811 --> 00:00:24,655
Processing…

6
00:00:25,015 --> 00:00:27,906
First line: ‘Please’. Second line:
‘Please’.

7
00:00:28,256 --> 00:00:29,466
That’s… oddly specific.

8
00:00:29,816 --> 00:00:35,045
I’ve seen ‘please’ used in accounting.
It’s polite.

9
00:00:40,887 --> 00:00:44,078
He also writes ‘think carefully’ after
every request.

10
00:00:44,438 --> 00:00:46,488
So the AI just obeys because it’s polite?

11
00:00:46,813 --> 00:00:48,292
Please… think carefully…

12
00:00:54,124 --> 00:00:56,939
We’re terminating your contract, please.
